SUMMARY:Iowa: statutory sale date (Third Monday in June)
DESCRIPTION:Tax sale the third Monday of June\; 2% per month\; bidders bid down the share of the parcel they would take.
URL:https://shamarrobinson.github.io/us-tax-sale-dashboard/#ia
END:VEVENT
