SUMMARY:Missouri: statutory sale date (Fourth Monday in August)
DESCRIPTION:County Collectors hold tax sales the fourth Monday of August\; 1-year redemption at 10% for first and second offerings\, shorter for later ones.
URL:https://shamarrobinson.github.io/us-tax-sale-dashboard/#mo
END:VEVENT
